/*
 * The Anton / Adirek800 / Poppins400 / Poppins500 / Poppins700 declarations
 * have been disabled because their .woff2/.woff files do not exist in the
 * theme assets directory and were returning HTTP 404 from the Shopify CDN.
 * `font-display: swap` was already falling back to the next font in the stack,
 * so removing the broken @font-face rules eliminates 5 wasted requests per page
 * without changing visual rendering. Re-enable each block after uploading the
 * matching font file to /assets/.
 */

